alue of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and January to February came in under 90% of normal in 34 of them. In 2025, August to September on the middle of the grids was 51% of normal, and July to August was 71%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 214% and May to June at 72%. Grid 27481 had its driest year in 1953 at 66% of normal.</p>"}
